 guistics\nWebsite: https://2027.coling-iccl.org/\nSource URL: https://202
 7.coling-iccl.org/calls/main_conference_papers/\nLocation: Macau\, China\
 nTopics: Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, Deep Representation Learnin
 g\, Knowledge Representation & Reasoning\, LLM Agents & Tool Use\nSize: X
 L\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date
 : 2026-10-07\nNotes: Main in-person window May 9-14\; separate virtual se
